// A touch-ally protective pact. D&D's "the caster shares/splits the
// warded ally's incoming wounds" has no damage-redirect or damage-share
// primitive in this engine (checked every `BuffEffect` in
// common/src/comp/buff.rs), so that half is dropped -- the same
// documented gap sanctuary.ron/protection_from_evil_and_good.ron already
// carry for their own D&D riders with no fitting mechanism. Ships as the
// "+AC/+saves" half only, via the same flat `ProtectingWard` reduction this
// file's touch-ally wards already share, held for the sheet's own
// non-concentration 1-hour duration.
BasicAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    targets: InGroup,
    auras: [
        (
            kind: ProtectingWard,
            strength: 0.2,
            duration: Some(3600.0),
            category: Some(Magical),
        ),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(3600.0),
    range: 2.0,
    energy_cost: 35.0,
    scales_with_combo: false,
    specifier: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Divine)),
)
